@startuml Component_Diagram

title Hybrid Attack System - Component Architecture

skinparam componentStyle rectangle
skinparam backgroundColor #FEFEFE
skinparam roundcorner 10

package "User Interface" {
    [Main Program] as Main
    [CLI Interface] as CLI
    [Configuration] as Config
}

package "Attack Strategies" {
    [Strategy Interface] as Strategy
    [Dictionary Attack] as Dict
    [Brute Force Attack] as Brute
    [Parallel Brute Force] as Parallel
}

package "Core Engine" {
    [Hybrid Attack Orchestrator] as Orchestrator
    [Result Aggregator] as Aggregator
    [Progress Monitor] as Monitor
}

package "Worker Pool" {
    [Worker Manager] as Manager
    [Worker 1] as W1
    [Worker 2] as W2
    [Worker 3] as W3
    [Worker 4] as W4
}

package "Utilities" {
    [Password Generator] as PassGen
    [String Comparator] as Compare
    [Time Tracker] as Time
    [Logger] as Log
}

package "Data Storage" {
    database "Dictionary\nDatabase" as DictDB
    database "Result\nChannel" as ResultChan
    database "Configuration\nStore" as ConfigStore
}

' User Interface connections
Main --> CLI : uses
CLI --> Config : loads
Config --> ConfigStore : reads/writes

' Main flow
Main --> Orchestrator : initiates
Orchestrator --> Strategy : uses
Strategy <|-- Dict : implements
Strategy <|-- Brute : implements
Strategy <|-- Parallel : implements

' Attack strategies
Dict --> DictDB : reads passwords
Dict --> Compare : uses
Dict --> Aggregator : sends results

Brute --> PassGen : generates combinations
Brute --> Compare : uses
Brute --> Aggregator : sends results

Parallel --> Manager : manages workers
Manager --> W1 : launches
Manager --> W2 : launches
Manager --> W3 : launches
Manager --> W4 : launches

W1 --> PassGen : uses
W2 --> PassGen : uses
W3 --> PassGen : uses
W4 --> PassGen : uses

W1 --> ResultChan : sends results
W2 --> ResultChan : sends results
W3 --> ResultChan : sends results
W4 --> ResultChan : sends results

Parallel --> ResultChan : monitors
Parallel --> Aggregator : forwards results

' Utilities
Orchestrator --> Monitor : tracks progress
Orchestrator --> Time : measures duration
Orchestrator --> Log : writes logs

Monitor --> CLI : updates display
Time --> Aggregator : provides timing

' Result flow
Aggregator --> Main : returns final result

note right of Orchestrator
    Central coordinator:
    1. Runs Dictionary Attack
    2. If failed, runs Parallel Brute Force
    3. Aggregates and returns results
end note

note bottom of Manager
    Manages worker pool:
    • Distributes work ranges
    • Monitors worker status
    • Handles early termination
    • Collects results
end note

note left of DictDB
    Contains common passwords:
    • Top 10,000 passwords
    • Previously leaked passwords
    • Common patterns
    • User-defined passwords
end note

note right of ResultChan
    Go channel for communication:
    • Workers send results here
    • Non-blocking checks
    • First result wins
    • Thread-safe
end note

@enduml
